# USV camera boat (sim/models/usv_camera_boat), flown as ArduRover.
#
# ArduPilot has no boat vehicle: a boat is a Rover with FRAME_CLASS 2, which
# switches it to a surface-vessel motion model (no reverse-steering assumptions,
# and it will not try to pivot like a wheeled rover).
FRAME_CLASS 2

# Skid steering. Matches the USV's thruster channels:
#   SERVO1 ThrottleLeft  (73) -> control channel 0 -> port thruster
#   SERVO3 ThrottleRight (74) -> control channel 2 -> stbd thruster
SERVO1_FUNCTION 73
SERVO3_FUNCTION 74
